// @name: p5 — code voice
// @tagline: an explicit tag, no actor needed
// @description: A code voice via the explicit tag form (p5: …): no code-voice actor is declared, the tag gives the language directly. Equivalent to an eval.p5 actor by inheritance. The sketch draws to the p5 canvas, placed in time by the dispatcher.
